---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '@/styles/globals.css'
import '@/styles/normalize.css'
import SpaceForSidebar from "@/components/SpaceForDesktopSidebar.astro"
import WhereToFindMeSection from '@/components/WhereToFindMeSection.astro';

---

<Layout title="Janet Spellman's About Me">

          
    
    <main class=" flex">
        <SpaceForSidebar />
       <section class="mb-12">
        <section class="mt-10 px-2 md:px-12 max-w-7xl">
                         <h1 class="font-Ayaka text-4xl text-center pb-8" id="about">About Me (Your New Developer)</h1>

            <img class="max-w-[600px] mx-auto w-full"src="/images/me.jpg"/>
         

            <p class="mt-8"> Hi there, thanks for visiting! My "Spellman Magic" is software development*. </p>
            
            <p class="mt-4 mb-4">  I've always enjoyed using technology, whether by:  </p>
                        
                        <ul class="list-disc mx-auto pl-8 space-y-4"> 
                        <li> Building computers. </li>
                        <li> Playing classic games like Final Fantasy 7 with emulators. </li>
                         <li> Styling MySpace and Neopets profiles. </li>
                         <li> Or saving others from technical issues such as vengeful printers and stubborn computer errors.</li>
                
                </ul>
            
            <p class="mt-4"> My journey to code actually began when I worked at an animal shelter! I built an automated audiobook program, which reduced the stress levels of shelter pets and increased positive outcomes. Every since then, I've been using code to solve real world problems by building websites and full-stack applications. </p>

           <p class="mt-4">* If "Spellman Magic" does not ring a bell, look up Sabrina the Teenage Witch. It was a popular 90s sitcom following the "Spellman" family of witches. Coincidentally (or magically?), that is my last name too. 😉.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-center mb-8 font-Ayaka text-4xl" id="more-about-me">More about me: </h3>
                <div class="flex justify-center">
                <ul class="mx-auto space-y-4">                  
                     <li> 🧩 Codewars/ Coding Challenge Fanatic. </li>
                     <li> 🎬 📚 🎮 Fantasy Lover. </li>
                     <li> 🎮 Favorite Games: Hades, Baldur's gate 3, Untitled Goose Game, and Final Fantasy 14. </li>
                     <li> 🏞️ When the weather cooperates, I'm always hyped to go hiking! </li>
                  
                     <li> 📚 I've read a few novels in Japanese and I'm currently working on <span class="line-through">mastering</span> getting half decent at Spanish. </li>
                     <li> 🐱🐶 enthusiast. </li>
                     <li> 🐈 Always adding more features to our 2 catios! (Enclosed outside areas for cats).</li>
                     <li>🧔 Caution: Approaching puns and dad jokes ahead. Eye-rolls may be unavoidable! </li>
                </div>
    
    

    
        </section>
         <section class="pt-12 px-2 md:px-12 mb-8">

         <h2 class="font-Ayaka text-4xl text-center mb-8" id="socials" >Where to find me </h2>

       
         <WhereToFindMeSection/>
       
         </section>


        </section>
    </main>


    </div>
</Layout>